Z||000006||Denny||09-02-2001||10:39 AM||||  <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Brian87egotrip:<BR><B>I'm a computer dumba$$ Hoiw do you clear the cache? I can't get into the site either. I tried refresh it didn't work. Any help would be appreciated. I need to spend my money on fiero stuff! </B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><BR>Open Internet Explorer, then select "Tools"  in the top menu bar, and then "Internet Options." Select "Delete Files" in the "Temporary Internet Files" section. Please be aware that you'll also be blowing away any "remembered" configurations for personalized pages at other sites.<p>[This message has been edited by Denny (edited 09-02-2001).]||||reg||1
